{"seq":3,"slug":"climate-justice","title":"气候正义","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/frontier-economics/climate-economics/climate-justice","wordCount":2671,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"气候正义\">气候正义</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>气候正义（Climate Justice）将气候变化从一个&quot;效率问题&quot;重新定义为一个&quot;公平问题&quot;。当经济学家用 Nordhaus 的 DICE 模型计算&quot;最优碳排放路径&quot;时，模型背后隐含的分配假设——谁的损失被加权更高、哪一代人的福利更重要、哪些国家应该承担更多减排责任——实际上是伦理选择而非技术参数。贴现率之争（Nordhaus vs. Stern）不是关于贴现率&quot;应该是多少&quot;的计量问题，而是关于&quot;当代人是否有权利以牺牲未来世代的利益来享受廉价能源&quot;的代际正义问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"贴现率之争-代际公平的核心战场\">贴现率之争：代际公平的核心战场</h3><p>气候政策的成本-收益分析中，社会贴现率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 是最具争议的参数。Ramsey 方程给出了社会贴现率的理论分解：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>δ</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = \\delta + \\eta \\cdot g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 是纯时间偏好率（pure rate of time preference），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 是边际效用弹性（消费的社会曲率），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 是人均消费增长率。</p>\n<p><strong>Nordhaus 立场</strong>（描述性方法，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\approx 4\\text{-}5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>）：贴现率应该反映资本市场的实际回报率——市场利率揭示了社会对当下消费 vs. 未来消费的真实偏好。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta \\approx 1.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5%</span></span></span></span></span> 反映了人们确实在乎当下多于未来，这不是道德缺陷而是人类行为的客观特征。</p>\n<p><strong>Stern 立场</strong>（规范性方法，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r \\approx 1.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4%</span></span></span></span></span>）：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 应该接近零——没有伦理理由仅仅因为未来世代&quot;尚未出生&quot;就给他们的福利打折扣。唯一合理的正 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span> 来源是物种灭绝的小概率（约 0.1%/年）。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>（对数效用），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g = 1.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3%</span></span></span></span></span>，得出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>1.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r = 0.1\\% + 1 \\times 1.3\\% = 1.4\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.1%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.4%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[贴现率之争] --&gt; B[Nordhaus 描述性]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Stern 规范性]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;δ ≈ 1.5%, η = 2, g = 2%&quot;]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[&quot;r ≈ 5.5%&quot;]&#10;    B2 --&gt; B3[SCC ≈ $30-50/tCO₂]&#10;    B3 --&gt; B4[渐进减排路径]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;δ ≈ 0.1%, η = 1, g = 1.3%&quot;]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[&quot;r ≈ 1.4%&quot;]&#10;    C2 --&gt; C3[SCC ≈ $200+/tCO₂]&#10;    C3 --&gt; C4[立即大规模减排]\">graph TD\n    A[贴现率之争] --&gt; B[Nordhaus 描述性]\n    A --&gt; C[Stern 规范性]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"δ ≈ 1.5%, η = 2, g = 2%\"]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[\"r ≈ 5.5%\"]\n    B2 --&gt; B3[SCC ≈ $30-50/tCO₂]\n    B3 --&gt; B4[渐进减排路径]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"δ ≈ 0.1%, η = 1, g = 1.3%\"]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[\"r ≈ 1.4%\"]\n    C2 --&gt; C3[SCC ≈ $200+/tCO₂]\n    C3 --&gt; C4[立即大规模减排]</pre><p>这不仅仅是参数选择的技术分歧。高贴现率意味着未来的气候灾难在今天看来&quot;不值得花太多钱预防&quot;——因为未来世代理论上会更富有（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>），额外一单位消费对他们的边际效用更低。但这个论证的前提恰恰被气候变化本身威胁——如果气候灾难导致未来世代更贫穷，高贴现率的前提就不成立了。</p>\n<p>Weitzman (2009) 的&quot;肥尾论&quot;（Fat-Tailed Catastrophe）提供了另一个视角：气候系统的极端不确定性（气候敏感度的概率分布有厚尾）意味着灾难性结果的概率不可忽略。在极端损害下，期望损失可能是无限的——此时贴现率的选择变得次要，风险管理的逻辑取代了成本收益分析。</p>\n<h3 id=\"国际气候正义-共同但有区别的责任\">国际气候正义：共同但有区别的责任</h3><p>气候变化的国际政治建立在一个根本性的不对称上：历史排放主要由发达国家贡献，但气候变化的损害主要由发展中国家承受。</p>\n<p>累计 CO₂ 排放的历史分布：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>国家/地区</th>\n<th>1850-2023 累计排放份额</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>~25%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>~22%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td>~13%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>印度</td>\n<td>~3%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非洲全境</td>\n<td>~3%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>UNFCCC 的&quot;共同但有区别的责任&quot;原则（Common But Differentiated Responsibilities, CBDR）承认这种历史不对称，但其具体实施一直是谈判的核心争议：</p>\n<p><strong>排放权的分配正义</strong>：如果每个人有平等的&quot;碳排放权&quot;，按人均分配全球碳预算，发展中国家将获得远超其当前排放量的配额——而发达国家已经严重&quot;超支&quot;。印度和非洲学者倾向于支持人均等量原则（Equal Per Capita），而发达国家更倾向于基于当前排放的&quot;祖父条款&quot;（Grandfathering）方法。</p>\n<p><strong>气候融资</strong>：巴黎协定中，发达国家承诺每年向发展中国家提供至少 1000 亿美元的气候融资——但这一承诺长期未能兑现。COP28 将目标提升至每年 3000 亿美元。气候融资面临的核心问题是：这笔钱是&quot;赠款&quot;还是&quot;贷款&quot;？是&quot;赔偿&quot;还是&quot;援助&quot;？不同的定性对应不同的正义逻辑。</p>\n<p><strong>损失与损害（Loss and Damage）</strong>：COP27 的标志性成果是建立了损失与损害基金——首次承认发达国家对气候变化已经造成的不可逆损害负有补偿责任。但基金的规模（初始仅约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>亿）与实际损失（发展中国家每年气候损失估计超过</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7 亿）与实际损失（发展中国家每年气候损失估计超过</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">亿）与实际损失（发展中国家每年气候损失估计超过</span></span></span></span></span>4000 亿）之间存在巨大缺口。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[国际气候正义维度] --&gt; B[分配正义]&#10;    A --&gt; C[矫正正义]&#10;    A --&gt; D[程序正义]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[人均排放权]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[碳预算分配]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[历史排放责任]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[损失与损害补偿]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[谈判权力对称]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[脆弱群体代表性]\">graph LR\n    A[国际气候正义维度] --&gt; B[分配正义]\n    A --&gt; C[矫正正义]\n    A --&gt; D[程序正义]\n    B --&gt; B1[人均排放权]\n    B --&gt; B2[碳预算分配]\n    C --&gt; C1[历史排放责任]\n    C --&gt; C2[损失与损害补偿]\n    D --&gt; D1[谈判权力对称]\n    D --&gt; D2[脆弱群体代表性]</pre><h3 id=\"国内分配正义-碳定价的回归性\">国内分配正义：碳定价的回归性</h3><p>碳定价政策在国内也面临严峻的分配挑战。碳税或 ETS 传导至消费者的成本负担通常是回归性的——低收入家庭将更高比例的收入用于能源和交通，因此承受更高的相对碳成本负担。</p>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span> 为碳税，家庭 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的碳成本负担为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B_i = \\tau \\cdot E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是家庭碳足迹。碳税的回归性可以用负担率（burden rate）的收入弹性来衡量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><msub><mi>B</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_B = \\frac{\\partial(B_i/Y_i)}{\\partial Y_i} \\cdot \\frac{Y_i}{B_i/Y_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.263em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2963em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0502em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_B &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 时，碳税是回归性的——低收入家庭承受更高比例的负担。实证研究一致发现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mi>B</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>0.6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-0.6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.6</span></span></span></span></span> 之间。</p>\n<p><strong>补偿机制设计</strong>：碳税收入的再分配可以完全抵消甚至逆转回归性。主要方案包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方案</th>\n<th>分配效应</th>\n<th>效率影响</th>\n<th>政治可行性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等额退税（Carbon Dividend）</td>\n<td>累进</td>\n<td>中性</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>降低所得税</td>\n<td>回归</td>\n<td>正效率</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定向补贴低收入户</td>\n<td>强累进</td>\n<td>可能扭曲</td>\n<td>低（瞄准成本高）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>投资清洁基础设施</td>\n<td>间接受益</td>\n<td>长期正效率</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>加拿大的碳退税经验表明，将 90% 的碳税收入直接以等额现金形式返还给居民，使约 80% 的家庭在考虑碳税和退税后净受益——这有效地将碳税从回归性政策转化为累进性政策。</p>\n<h3 id=\"脆弱性与适应正义\">脆弱性与适应正义</h3><p>气候正义不仅关乎减排（mitigation），也关乎适应（adaptation）。气候脆弱性的分布高度不均匀：</p>\n<p><strong>地理脆弱性</strong>：小岛屿国家面临海平面上升的生存威胁；撒哈拉以南非洲面临农业生产力的严重下降；南亚面临极端高温和洪水的双重风险。这些地区对历史排放的贡献微乎其微。</p>\n<p><strong>社会经济脆弱性</strong>：即使在同一国家内，气候影响也不是均匀分布的。低收入社区往往位于洪泛区或热岛效应严重的城市中心，缺乏空调、保险和流动能力来应对极端天气。</p>\n<p><strong>适应能力的不对称</strong>：适应需要资源——海堤、灌溉系统、耐旱品种、早期预警系统——而最需要适应的国家和社区恰恰最缺乏这些资源。这产生了&quot;适应赤字&quot;（Adaptation Deficit）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"气候诉讼-正义的司法化\">气候诉讼：正义的司法化</h3><p>气候正义正在从政策领域延伸到司法领域。全球气候诉讼案件从 2015 年的约 900 件增长到 2023 年的超过 2300 件。关键案例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Urgenda v. Netherlands (2019)</strong>：荷兰最高法院裁定政府有法律义务在 2020 年前将排放量减少至少 25%——基于欧洲人权公约第 2 条（生命权）和第 8 条（私生活权）</li>\n<li><strong>Neubauer v. Germany (2021)</strong>：德国联邦宪法法院裁定气候保护法的 2030 年减排目标不够充分，因为这将过多的减排负担转嫁给了年轻世代，侵犯了他们的&quot;未来自由&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Montana Youth v. Montana (2023)</strong>：美国蒙大拿州法院裁定该州推动化石燃料开发的政策违反了州宪法中&quot;清洁健康环境&quot;的权利</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些案例正在构建一套&quot;气候人权法学&quot;——将气候变化纳入基本权利框架，为公民提供了超越选举政治的问责路径。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>使用 Ramsey 方程，计算以下两组参数下的社会贴现率并比较政策含义：(a) <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 0, \\eta = 2, g = 1\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1%</span></span></span></span></span>；(b) <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1.5</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta = 2\\%, \\eta = 1.5, g = 2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9444em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.5</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2%</span></span></span></span></span>。如果气候灾难导致 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 从正转负，两组参数下的贴现率如何变化？</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某发展中国家在 COP 谈判中提出&quot;基于历史排放的碳债务&quot;概念——发达国家应该为其超额的历史排放支付补偿。用经济学语言形式化这个概念，讨论其可行性和公平性。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个碳税+补偿方案：假设中国实施全国碳税 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau = 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 元/tCO₂，估计对收入十分位各组的负担率，并设计一个使底层 50% 家庭净受益的再分配方案。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>气候诉讼是否是推动气候正义的有效途径？分析 Urgenda 案的法律逻辑——法院如何将减排义务从政策目标转化为法律义务？这种路径在中国的法律体系下是否可行？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Gardiner, S. M. (2011)</strong>. <em>A Perfect Moral Storm: The Ethical Tragedy of Climate Change</em>. 从道德哲学角度系统分析气候变化的代际正义和国际正义问题。</li>\n<li><strong>Nordhaus, W. (2008)</strong>. <em>A Question of Balance: Weighing the Options on Global Warming Policies</em>. Nordhaus 对描述性贴现率方法的系统辩护。</li>\n<li><strong>Stern, N. (2007)</strong>. <em>The Economics of Climate Change: The Stern Review</em>. 第 2 章对贴现率的伦理讨论是规范性方法的代表。</li>\n<li><strong>Weitzman, M. L. (2009)</strong>. &quot;On Modeling and Interpreting the Economics of Catastrophic Climate Change&quot;. <em>Review of Economics and Statistics</em>. 肥尾灾难论的原始论文。</li>\n<li><strong>Setzer, J. &amp; Higham, C. (2023)</strong>. <em>Global Trends in Climate Change Litigation</em>. Grantham Research Institute 的年度气候诉讼报告。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>气候正义将气候经济学从效率优化扩展到公平分配的维度。贴现率之争表明，气候政策的核心分歧不在于技术参数而在于伦理立场——如何权衡当代与未来世代的利益、如何在历史排放者与脆弱承受者之间分配责任。国际层面的 CBDR 原则和损失与损害基金正在缓慢建立一套气候补偿的制度框架，但资金规模远不及实际需求。国内层面的碳税回归性问题可以通过收入再分配有效解决——加拿大的碳退税经验证明了这一点。气候诉讼作为新兴路径，正在将气候承诺从政治宣言转化为可执行的法律义务。气候正义不是气候经济学的&quot;附录&quot;，而是其政治可持续性和社会合法性的根基。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"气候正义","id":"气候正义"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"贴现率之争：代际公平的核心战场","id":"贴现率之争-代际公平的核心战场"},{"level":3,"text":"国际气候正义：共同但有区别的责任","id":"国际气候正义-共同但有区别的责任"},{"level":3,"text":"国内分配正义：碳定价的回归性","id":"国内分配正义-碳定价的回归性"},{"level":3,"text":"脆弱性与适应正义","id":"脆弱性与适应正义"},{"level":3,"text":"气候诉讼：正义的司法化","id":"气候诉讼-正义的司法化"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"绿色转型路径","url":"/l-doc-books/education/phd/economics/frontier-economics/climate-economics/green-transition"},"next":null}